A job search can quickly turn into a collection of tabs, notes, and unfinished applications.

30
00:02:28,905 --> 00:02:37,855
CareerOS brings that work into one place. The briefing starts with the opportunities that need attention, and the decisions to make next.

31
00:02:38,155 --> 00:02:42,180
